    "turn_text": "Well, I mean, it might be down, but in the grand equation, over 10 million illegals is more than the population of the entire state of Indiana that have flooded our country on Joe Biden's watch. And even Democrats admit that those numbers are accurate or probably even a low estimate of what's happened over the last four years. So it might be there might be a blip. It might be down for the moment, but that doesn't mean that That doesn't mean that there's art still illegals flooding into our country because the Biden border policies until you go back to Trump policies, remain in Mexico, complete construction of the wall and stop the catch and release policies of the Biden administration. of this is fixed. And Donald Trump, by the way, is equipped to fix it on day one. When he's sworn in on January 20, he's going to go back to the White House after taking the oath of office and sign executive orders to put those policies back in place. But Congress has to act to this is why we have to have a majority in the United States Senate of Republicans grow the majority in the house and then make these these law these Trump policies the law of the land to secure the border to save this country that'll be our first mission when I get to the United States Senate",
